    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u15.d04.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Giving hypothetical advice",
        "ru": "Гипотетический совет"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "Give strong advice with \"If I were you, I would/wouldn't …\". Soften it with \"You could …\", \"I'd probably …\" or \"In your position, I would …\".",
        "ru": "Настойчивый совет — \"If I were you, I would/wouldn't …\". Мягче — \"You could …\", \"I'd probably …\" или \"In your position, I would …\"."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "If I were you",
            "ru": "If I were you"
          },
          "formula": "If I were you, I would/wouldn't …",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "If I were you, I wouldn't rush the decision.",
              "ru": "На твоём месте я бы не торопился с решением."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "second-conditional"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "softer advice",
            "ru": "мягкий совет"
          },
          "formula": "You could … / I'd probably …",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "You could talk to her first. I'd probably wait.",
              "ru": "Ты мог бы сначала поговорить с ней. Я бы, наверное, подождал."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "second-conditional"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "in your position",
            "ru": "на твоём месте"
          },
          "formula": "In your position, I would …",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "In your position, I would take the risk.",
              "ru": "На твоём месте я бы рискнул."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "second-conditional"
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "Advice uses \"were\" (not \"was\"): \"If I were you\", not \"If I was you\".",
          "ru": "В совете — \"were\" (не \"was\"): \"If I were you\", а не \"If I was you\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"advice\" is the noun, \"advise\" is the verb: \"give advice\", \"advise someone\".",
          "ru": "\"advice\" — существительное, \"advise\" — глагол: \"give advice\", \"advise someone\"."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u15.d04.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "A big decision",
        "ru": "Большое решение"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u15.d04.reading.b1",
          "en": "\"I don't know what to do,\" said Sam. \"They offered me a job abroad, but Anna wants to settle down here.\" His brother listened carefully. \"If I were you, I wouldn't decide too quickly. This is about your future, not just one job.\"",
          "ru": "«Я не знаю, что делать, — сказал Сэм. — Мне предложили работу за границей, но Анна хочет осесть здесь». Брат внимательно слушал. «На твоём месте я бы не решал слишком быстро. Речь о твоём будущем, а не об одной работе».",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u15.d04.reading.b1.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u15.d04.reading.b2",
          "en": "\"In your position, I would talk to Anna honestly and think about it together. You could even visit the city first. My advice? Don't take a risk this big alone — but don't give up on your dream either.\"",
          "ru": "«На твоём месте я бы честно поговорил с Анной и подумал вместе. Ты мог бы даже сначала съездить в тот город. Мой совет? Не рискуй так сильно в одиночку — но и от мечты не отказывайся».",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u15.d04.reading.b2.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "word": "honestly",
          "ru": "честно",
          "ipa": "/ˈɒnɪstli/"
        },
        {
          "word": "together",
          "ru": "вместе",
          "ipa": "/təˈɡeðər/"
        }
      ]
    },
